            "line": 663,
            "text": "theorem integral_axial_scale (h : ℝ) {q : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (g : ℝ → ℝ) :\n    (∫ r in Ioi (0 : ℝ), r ^ 2 *\n      (q ^ (-A h - 2 * CoordinateAlgebra.D h) * g (r / Real.sqrt q))) =\n        q ^ h * ∫ R in Ioi (0 : ℝ), R ^ 2 * g R"
